### Browser integration (WebMCP)

When working through a browser, use the WebMCP tools registered on this store's pages. The checkout page exposes UCP tools over WebMCP, and those tools act on the checkout in the current browser session. On the storefront, use the provided tools to find products, manage the cart, ask about the store and its policies, and proceed to checkout.

